flowchart LR
    subgraph Sites[Tracked Websites]
        W1[Marketing Site<br/>tracking.js]
        W2[Docs Site<br/>tracking.js]
        W3[E-commerce Site<br/>tracking.js]
        WN[N more websites]
    end

    subgraph API[InsightTrack Backend - Express 3001]
        T[Tracking Routes<br/>POST /track/*]
        A[Analytics Routes<br/>GET /api/analytics/*]
        Auth[Auth and Sites Routes<br/>/api/auth, /api/sites]
        C[(In-memory Cache<br/>TTL 10s 30s 60s 120s)]
        S[Incremental Sync Worker<br/>High-water mark]
    end

    PG[(PostgreSQL 5432<br/>Source of truth<br/>Write optimized)]
    D[(DuckDB embedded<br/>Analytics replica<br/>Read optimized)]
    UI[Dashboard SPA<br/>React + Vite 5173]

    W1 -->|sendBeacon/fetch events| T
    W2 -->|sendBeacon/fetch events| T
    W3 -->|sendBeacon/fetch events| T
    WN -->|sendBeacon/fetch events| T

    T -->|INSERT events/sessions| PG
    Auth -->|CRUD users/sites/funnels| PG

    PG -->|incremental sync| S
    S -->|upsert analytics tables| D

    UI -->|JWT + HTTP| A
    A --> C
    C -->|cache miss| D
    D -->|aggregations| A
    A -->|JSON response| UI
